   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This method returns a list pending changes to the set of SoftwareClusters on the adaptive platform. The returned list includes all SoftwareClusters that are to be added, updated or removed. The list of changes is extended in the course of processing Software Packages.</p></div>",
